    PnP playbook: forbid raw Lean/lake, require managed compiler
    
    Unmanaged lean/lake in a pnp worktree trips build_control.legacy_compilers() and defers every managed compile (exit 75), blocking kernel receipts. Make the bound-worker instruction explicit.

